# Lock a worktree from the sidebar menu, then open the menu again. The lock exists in git, so the
# menu should now offer Unlock. The stash age depends on today's date, so it is masked.
fixture linked
wait text "chore: add libsub"
mask-text "on main • [^│┃]*"
click 8 43 right
click 10 44
wait stable
move 140 40
snapshot locked
click 8 43 right
snapshot menu-after-lock
